# CLARION CALL: every area but the Crown is generated for each run. Over
# 200 seeds, all fourteen generated areas of all seven regions (2,800 maps):
# every note, every door's landing spot and the gold door's are reachable
# by the ship from where it starts (on the real collision rules), each
# door stands on a level floor with a short walk from its landing spot,
# and a note waits close to the start. The cave pieces are all sound. An
# area holds fourteen notes, clock-ring spots, pods, and its region's own
# enemies.
seed 1
game clarion
wait 10
expect pieces_bad == 0
expect gen_bad200 == 0
cheat area 0 0
wait 2
expect notes_left == 14
expect nrings >= 6
expect count20 >= 4
cheat area 1 1
wait 2
expect world_bad == 0
cheat area 3 1
wait 2
expect count7 >= 1
cheat area 4 0
wait 2
expect count11 >= 1
cheat area 5 0
wait 2
expect count24 >= 3
expect dark == 1
cheat area 6 1
wait 2
expect count16 >= 1
cheat area 2 0
wait 2
expect count5 >= 1
